Package: secubox-vortex-dns
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Description: retired package, nothing replaces it
 vortex-dns (RPZ firewall) was never wired to the resolver: the only DNS
 engine is Unbound, driven by secubox-ad-guard and secubox-webfilter. This
 empty package removes the old files and service on upgrade; it can be
 removed once nothing depends on it.
